ist). Terminals C, NC, NO ASSUMED.</elementInformation><elementInformation name="designation_auxiliary1" show="0">iOF auxiliary contact, Acti9, 1 changeover, AC/DC</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_auxiliary1" show="0">Schneider Electric</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference_auxiliary1" show="0">A9A26924</elementInformation><elementInformation name="quantity_auxiliary1" show="0">0</elementInformation><elementInformation name="auxiliary2" show="0">Compatible accessory</elementInformation><elementInformation name="description_auxiliary2" show="0">Add-on residual current device Vigi iC60, 3P, 25 A, 30 mA, type AC, instantaneous, 400-415 V AC, for iC60. Width 6 x 9 mm (54 mm), height 91 mm, depth 73.5 mm. Discontinued 23 Sept 2025, not replaced. Mounted next to an iC60: its own terminals are drawn.</elementInformation><elementInformation name="designation_auxiliary2" show="0">Vigi iC60 add-on residual current device, 3P, 25 A, 30 mA, type AC</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_auxiliary2" show="0">Schneider Electric</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference_auxiliary2" show="0">A9V11325</elementInformation><elementInformation name="quantity_auxiliary2" show="0">0</elementInformation></elementInformations><dynamic_texts><dynamic_elmt_text Halignment="AlignLeft" Valignment="AlignTop" font="Liberation Sans,9,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0,Regular" frame="false" keep_visual_rotation="true" rotation="0" text_from="ElementInfo" text_width="-1" x="-15" y="73" rotation_point_center="false" uuid="{54905051-d6fb-59bb-8f32-edf6bef7e6ba}"><text>-Q3</text><info_name>label</info_name></dynamic_elmt_text></dynamic_texts><texts_groups /></element><element freezeLabel="false" is_movable="1" orientation="0" prefix="" type="embed://import/10_electric/20_manufacturers_articles/schneider/acti9_ic60/ic60n_4p/ic60n_4p.elmt" uuid="{779c824b-18df-5733-b126-f05bce79a3e6}" x="520" y="150" z="10"><terminal