D/SDE), the undervoltage release MN LV429410 (24 V DC) and the long terminal shields LV429517.</elementInformation><elementInformation name="auxiliary1" show="0">Compatible accessory</elementInformation><elementInformation name="description_auxiliary1" show="0">Standard motor mechanism module MT250 for ComPacT NSX250, control voltage 220-240 V AC 50/60 Hz (208-277 V AC 60 Hz), consumption below 500 VA, automatic spring charging, padlocking still possible, supplied with an SDE adapter. Motor terminals M1-M2 ASSUMED.</elementInformation><elementInformation name="designation_auxiliary1" show="0">Motor mechanism module MT250, ComPacT NSX250, 220/240 V AC</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_auxiliary1" show="0">Schneider Electric</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference_auxiliary1" show="0">LV431541</elementInformation><elementInformation name="quantity_auxiliary1" show="0">1</elementInformation><elementInformation name="auxiliary2" show="0">Compatible accessory</elementInformation><elementInformation name="description_auxiliary2" show="0">Standard auxiliary contact for ComPacT NSX, NS, PowerPact and EasyPact CVS: ON/OFF (OF), trip (SD), fault trip (SDE) and earth-fault trip (SDV) indication depending on its slot. One changeover contact (1 NO + 1 NC on a common point), 6 A, spring terminals. Terminals C, NC, NO.</elementInformation><elementInformation name="designation_auxiliary2" show="0">Auxiliary contact OF/SD/SDE/SDV, 1 changeover, spring terminals</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_auxiliary2" show="0">Schneider Electric</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference_auxiliary2" show="0">29450</elementInformation><elementInformation name="quantity_auxiliary2" show="0">1</elementInformation><elementInformation name="auxiliary3" show="0">Compatible accessory</elementInformation><elementInformation name="description_auxiliary3" show="0">Instantaneous undervoltage release MN for ComPacT NSX, 24 V DC, spring terminals. Coil terminals D1-D2 ASSUMED.</elementInformation><elementInformation name="designation_auxiliary3" show="0">MN undervoltage release, ComPacT NSX, 24 V DC, spring terminals</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_auxiliary3" show="0">Schneider Electric</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference_auxiliary3" show="0">LV429410</elementInformation><elementInformation name="quantity_auxiliary3" show="0">1</elementInformation><elementInformation name="auxiliary4" show="0">Compatible accessory</elementInformation><elementInformation name="description_auxiliary4" show="0">Long terminal shield for ComPacT NSX100/160/250, 3P, pole pitch 35 mm, degree of protection IP40. Mechanical accessory, no terminal.</elementInformation><elementInformation name="designation_auxiliary4" show="0">Long terminal shield, ComPacT NSX100/160/250, 3P</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_auxiliary4" show="0">Schneider Electric</elementInformation><elementInformation name="manufacturer_reference_auxiliary4" show="0">LV429517</elementInformation><elementInformation name="quantity_auxiliary4" show="0">1</elementInformation></elementInformations><dynamic_texts><dynamic_elmt_text Halignment="AlignLeft" Valignment="AlignTop" font="Liberation Sans,9,-1,5,50,0,0,0,0,0,Regular" frame="false" keep_visual_rotation="true" rotation="0" text_from="ElementInfo" text_width="-1" x="-55" y="503" rotation_point_center="false" uuid="{419723bb-342e-552c-a6f4-b1daf5629da9}"><text>-QS1</text><info_name>label</info_name></dynamic_elmt_text></dynamic_texts><texts_groups /></element><element freezeLabel="false" is_movable="1" orientation="0" prefix="" type="embed://import/10_electric/20_manufacturers_articles/schneider/accessories/mt250_220_240vac/mt250_220_240vac_realistic.elmt" uuid="{3757c577-47c3-53e1-b866-cc9b8e95e627}" x="570" y="100" z="10"><terminals><terminal id="0" orientation="s" x="100" y="250" /><ter